meta {
  name: Reset Setting
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/settings/MAX_ROWS
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  Delete the saved value so `.env` (or the built-in default) applies again. The path segment is the setting key (e.g. `MAX_ROWS`); unknown keys 404. Resetting `AZURE_OPENAI_KEY` also resets `AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT` and `AZURE_OPENAI_INSECURE_TLS`, so a `.env` key only ever goes to the `.env` endpoint. Audited as `SETTINGS_RESET`. Returns the same list as List Settings.

  Requires a valid Bearer JWT ({{token}}).
  **Admin only.**
}
